                <a href="/Customer/Safety" class="block px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-gray-600 hover:text-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-50/50 transition-all">Suất ăn sạch</a>
                <a href="/Customer/SafetyS" class="block px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-gray-600 hover:text-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-50/50 transition-all">Vệ sinh công nghiệp</a>
